<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Untuk Ananda Putri ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
overflow:hidden;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9ecf,#ffe4ec);
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
}

.card{
width:90%;
max-width:430px;
background:white;
padding:25px;
border-radius:20px;
text-align:center;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
position:relative;
z-index:2;
}

h1{
color:#ff2d75;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

p{
font-size:18px;
line-height:1.6;
margin-top:10px;
}

.scene{
height:140px;
position:relative;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.boy{
position:absolute;
left:-80px;
bottom:0;
font-size:75px;
animation:jalan 5s forwards;
}

.girl{
position:absolute;
right:20px;
bottom:0;
font-size:75px;
}

@keyframes jalan{
0%{left:-80px;}
100%{left:42%;}
}

button{
padding:12px 22px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
font-size:17px;
cursor:pointer;
margin:10px;
transition:.3s;
}

#yes{
background:#ff2d75;
color:white;
}

#no{
background:#ddd;
position:absolute;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
color:red;
animation:love 6s linear infinite;
opacity:.8;
}

@keyframes love{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:0;
}
20%{
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-120vh);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="card" id="card">

<div class="scene">
<div class="boy" id="boy">👦</div>
<div class="girl" id="girl">👧</div>
</div>

<h1>💖 Maafkan Bayu ya, Ananda Putri 💖</h1>

<p>

Mas benar-benar minta maaf kalau sudah membuat adek sedih.

<br><br>

Mas sadar mungkin ada kata-kata atau sikap yang membuat hati adek terluka.

<br><br>

🥺 Tapi satu hal yang ingin mas bilang...

<br><br>

❤️ <b>Mas sayang sama adekk.</b>

</p>

<div style="margin-top:20px;position:relative;height:70px">

<button id="yes" onclick="maaf()">Aku Maafkan ❤️</button>

<button id="no">Masih Ngambek 😤</button>

</div>

</div>

<script>

for(let i=0;i<40;i++){

let h=document.createElement("div");

h.className="heart";

h.innerHTML="❤️";

h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

h.style.fontSize=(15+Math.random()*25)+"px";

h.style.animationDelay=Math.random()*6+"s";

document.body.appendChild(h);

}

const no=document.getElementById("no");

no.addEventListener("mouseover",()=>{

no.style.left=Math.random()*220+"px";

no.style.top=Math.random()*40+"px";

});

function maaf(){

document.getElementById("boy").innerHTML="🫂";

document.getElementById("boy").style.left="42%";

document.getElementById("girl").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("card").innerHTML=`

<div style="font-size:90px">🫂</div>

<h1>Terima Kasih Sayang ❤️</h1>

<p>

Yeayyy... akhirnya adek memaafkan mas.

<br><br>

Mas janji akan menjaga hati adek.

<br><br>

❤️ Mas sayang sama adekk selamanya ❤️

</p>

`;

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
